Fast renderer rebuilt on the proven legacy PowerPoint engines.
The experimental Turbo preview engines are no longer used for fast staging. Promotion and Atacado now reuse PowerPointEngine.ps1 / AtacadoEngine.ps1, keeping one PowerPoint application per batch while preserving the historical open-fill-save-close cycle for each PPTX. Each item generates its temporary vector PDF and 300 dpi PNG preview in the same pass; final PDF generation validates and merges the cached vector PDFs. Any fast-item failure still falls back automatically to the proven normal renderer.
